      en: ["Total area of roughly 10,885 square kilometers", "Officially established as a national park in 1970", "Home to the rare and endemic Congo peacock", "Vital habitat for the endangered Grauer's gorilla", "One of the few places where okapis live in the wild", "The park spans across North Kivu, Maniema, and Orientale"],
